{"id":"verboten","lemma":"verboten","pos":"adj","rank":1350,"glosses":["forbidden, prohibited, banned"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈboːtn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/68/De-verboten.ogg/De-verboten.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das ist verboten.","en":"It's forbidden.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104511","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Rauchen ist in diesem Gebiet verboten.","en":"Smoking is forbidden in this area.","words":[{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"area, region"},null]},{"text":"Das Rauchen war im Restaurant verboten.","en":"Smoking in the restaurant was forbidden.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"restaurant"},null]},{"text":"Es ist streng verboten.","en":"It is strictly prohibited.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"strict, rigorous"},null]},{"text":"Schwimmen ist hier verboten.","en":"Swimming is prohibited here.","words":[{"g":"to swim"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"here"},null]}]}